      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Given your need to boost nitrogen without significantly altering your pH, I recommend blood meal over bone meal. Blood meal is a readily available source of nitrogen that won't drastically change your soil acidity compared to the phosphorus-rich bone meal. Apply it according to package directions and incorporate it into the topsoil to ensure even nutrient distribution.",
      "source": "target",
